description = "[PAWN_nameDef]'s thirst for power defined [PAWN_objective]. [PAWN_pronoun] quickly rose through the military ranks and soon attained the rank of general.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] was given the most challenging task - conquering distant and unexplored rimworlds. Victory here could even position [PAWN_objective] as a successor to the emperor."
